text: ['All creatures able to block Taunting Elf do so.', 'All creatures get +1/+1 until end of turn.', "As Urza's Incubator enters the battlefield, choose a creature type.\nCreature spells of the chosen type cost {2} less to cast.", 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\nReckless Abandon deals 4 damage to any target.', 'As long as Storage Matrix is untapped, each player chooses artifact, creature, or land during their untap step. That player can untap only permanents of the chosen type this step.', 'As long as Thran Golem is enchanted, it gets +2/+2 and has flying, first strike, and trample.', "At the beginning of each player's end step, if that player didn't cast a spell this turn, Impatience deals 2 damage to that player.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Masticore unless you discard a card.\n{2}: Masticore deals 1 damage to target creature.\n{2}: Regenerate Masticore.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a fuse counter on Powder Keg.\n{T}, Sacrifice Powder Keg: Destroy each artifact and creature with mana value equal to the number of fuse counters on Powder Keg.', 'Attacking creatures get +2/+0 until end of turn.', "Bubbling Beebles can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an enchantment.", "Counter target instant or sorcery spell. Search its controller's graveyard, hand, and library for all cards with the same name as that spell and exile them. Then that player shuffles.", 'Creatures you control get +0/+5 until end of turn.', "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nWall of Glare can block any number of creatures.", 'Destroy all enchantments. You gain 2 life for each enchantment destroyed this way.', 'Destroy target land and all other lands with the same name as that land.', 'Each other non-Aura enchantment is a creature in addition to its other types and has base power and base toughness each equal to its mana value.', 'Echo {2}{G} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nWhen Hunting Moa enters the battlefield or dies, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'Echo {2}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nWhen Keldon Vandals enters the battlefield, destroy target artifact.', 'Echo {4} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nSacrifice an artifact: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'Echo {4}{R}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nWhen Goblin Marshal enters the battlefield or dies, create two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', 'Enchant creature\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a fuse counter on Incendiary.\nWhen enchanted creature dies, Incendiary deals X damage to any target, where X is the number of fuse counters on Incendiary.', 'Enchant creature\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a growth counter on Momentum.\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 for each growth counter on Momentum.', 'Enchant creature\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a page counter on Private Research.\nWhen enchanted creature dies, draw a card for each page counter on Private Research.', 'Enchant creature\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may put an arrow counter on Archery Training.\nEnchanted creature has "{T}: This creature deals X damage to target attacking or blocking creature, where X is the number of arrow counters on Archery Training."', "Enchant creature\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may put an infection counter on Festering Wound.\nAt the beginning of the upkeep of enchanted creature's controller, Festering Wound deals X damage to that player, where X is the number of infection counters on Festering Wound.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1.\n{2}, Sacrifice Capashen Standard: Draw a card.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +3/-1.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has flying.\n{2}, Sacrifice Illuminated Wings: Draw a card.', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has haste.\nAt the beginning of the end step, return Mark of Fury to its owner's hand.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has protection from black and from red.', 'Enchant creature\nWhen Chime of Night is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, destroy target nonblack creature.', 'Enchant creature\nWhen Treachery enters the battlefield, untap up to five lands.\nYou control enchanted creature.', 'Enchant creature\nWhen enchanted creature dies, target player discards two cards.', "Enchant creature\nWhen enchanted creature dies, that creature's controller may search their library for a creature card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.", "Enchant creature\nWhenever enchanted creature deals damage to a player, return target creature that player controls to its owner's hand.", "Enchant creature\n{U}: Return enchanted creature and Disappear to their owners' hands.", "Exile target artifact. Search its controller's graveyard, hand, and library for all cards with the same name as that artifact and exile them. Then that player shuffles.", "Exile target enchantment. Search its controller's graveyard, hand, and library for all cards with the same name as that enchantment and exile them. Then that player shuffles.", "Exile target nonbasic land. Search its controller's graveyard, hand, and library for all cards with the same name as that land and exile them. Then that player shuffles.", "Exile target nonblack creature. Search its controller's graveyard, hand, and library for all cards with the same name as that creature and exile them. Then that player shuffles.", "Exile target nontoken permanent, then return it to the battlefield under its owner's control.", 'Exile up to three target cards from a single graveyard.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\n{1}{W}: Capashen Knight gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'First strike, haste', 'Flame Jet deals 3 damage to target player or planeswalker.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Fledgling Osprey has flying as long as it's enchanted.", 'Flying', "Flying\nWhen Aura Thief dies, you gain control of all enchantments. (You don't get to move Auras.)", 'Flying\nWhen Iridescent Drake enters the battlefield, put target Aura card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control attached to Iridescent Drake.', 'Flying\nWhen Junk Diver dies, return another target artifact card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Flying\nWhen Kingfisher dies, draw a card.', 'Flying\nWhen you control no artifacts, sacrifice Covetous Dragon.', 'Flying\nWhen you control no enchantments, sacrifice Tethered Griffin.', 'Flying\n{2}, Sacrifice Slinking Skirge: Draw a card.', 'Flying\n{3}{U}: Untap Blizzard Elemental.', 'Flying\n{T}: Target attacking or blocking creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nWhenever Thieving Magpie deals damage to an opponent, draw a card.", 'Flying, protection from blue', 'Flying, protection from green', 'Haste', 'Haste\nEcho {2}{R}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nWhen Keldon Champion enters the battlefield, it deals 3 damage to target player or planeswalker.', "Hulking Ogre can't block.", "Metathran Elite can't be blocked as long as it's enchanted.", "Metathran Soldier can't be blocked.", "Mountainwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)\n{R}: Colos Yearling gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt by target creature this turn.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Put two target lands on top of their owners' libraries.", 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', 'Return all enchantment cards from your graveyard to the battlefield. (Auras with nothing to enchant remain in your graveyard.)', "Return target permanent you control to its owner's hand.", 'Reveal any number of black cards in your hand. Target creature gets -X/-X until end of turn, where X is the number of cards revealed this way.', 'Reveal any number of blue cards in your hand. Counter target spell unless its controller pays {1} for each card revealed this way.', 'Reveal any number of green cards in your hand. Return an enchantment card from your graveyard to your hand for each card revealed this way.', 'Reveal any number of green cards in your hand. Target creature gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the number of cards revealed this way.', 'Reveal any number of red cards in your hand. Scent of Cinder deals X damage to any target, where X is the number of cards revealed this way.', 'Reveal any number of white cards in your hand. You gain 2 life for each card revealed this way.', 'Sacrifice any number of Mountains. Landslide deals that much damage to target player or planeswalker.', "Shroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", 'Skip your draw step.\nPay 1 life: Draw a card.', 'Tap an untapped creature you control: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to target creature this turn.', 'Tap an untapped creature you control: Tap target artifact, creature, or land.', 'Target player gains control of target permanent you control.', 'Target player loses 4 life and you gain 4 life.', 'Target player reveals their hand. You choose a nonbasic land card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target player skips their next draw step.', 'Trample', 'Trample\nWhenever Phyrexian Negator is dealt damage, sacrifice that many permanents.', 'Until end of turn, whenever a player taps a Swamp for mana, that player adds an additional {B}.', 'When Academy Rector dies, you may exile it. If you do, search your library for an enchantment card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'When Body Snatcher enters the battlefield, exile it unless you discard a creature card.\nWhen Body Snatcher dies, exile Body Snatcher and return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'When Disease Carriers dies, target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn.', 'When False Prophet dies, exile all creatures.', 'When Gamekeeper dies, you may exile it. If you do, reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a creature card. Put that card onto the battlefield and put all other cards revealed this way into your graveyard.', 'When Goblin Gardener dies, destroy target land.', 'When Goblin Masons dies, destroy target Wall.', 'When Marker Beetles dies, target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.\n{2}, Sacrifice Marker Beetles: Draw a card.', 'When Plague Dogs dies, all creatures get -1/-1 until end of turn.\n{2}, Sacrifice Plague Dogs: Draw a card.', 'When Ravenous Rats enters the battlefield, target opponent discards a card.', 'When Reliquary Monk dies, destroy target artifact or enchantment.', "When Telepathic Spies enters the battlefield, look at target opponent's hand.", 'When Yavimaya Elder dies, you may search your library for up to two basic land cards, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.\n{2}, Sacrifice Yavimaya Elder: Draw a card.', 'When an opponent has 10 or less life, if Lurking Jackals is an enchantment, it becomes a 3/2 Jackal creature.', 'When you cast a creature spell, sacrifice Skittering Horror.', 'When you control no other creatures, sacrifice Emperor Crocodile.', "Whenever a black card is put into an opponent's graveyard from anywhere, you may draw a card.", 'Whenever a creature attacks, Caltrops deals 1 damage to it.', 'Whenever a creature enters the battlefield, you lose 1 life and add {B}.', "Whenever a creature is dealt damage, Repercussion deals that much damage to that creature's controller.", 'Whenever an opponent casts a creature spell, Aether Sting deals 1 damage to that player.', 'Whenever an opponent taps a Mountain for mana, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever you or a permanent you control becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, you may draw a card. You may draw an additional card if Rayne, Academy Chancellor is enchanted.', 'Yavimaya Enchantress gets +1/+1 for each enchantment on the battlefield.', "You may have Thorn Elemental assign its combat damage as though it weren't blocked.", '{1}, {T}, Exile Thran Foundry: Target player shuffles their graveyard into their library.', '{1}{U}, Discard a card: Draw a card.', '{2}, Sacrifice Brass Secretary: Draw a card.', '{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Braidwood Sextant: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', '{2}: Goblin Festival deals 1 damage to any target. Flip a coin. If you lose the flip, choose one of your opponents. That player gains control of Goblin Festival.', "{2}: Mantis Engine gains flying until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\n{2}: Mantis Engine gains first strike until end of turn. (It deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)", '{2}{B}, {T}: Reveal any number of black cards in your hand. Target creature gets -X/-X until end of turn, where X is the number of cards revealed this way.', '{2}{G}, {T}: Reveal any number of green cards in your hand. Target creature gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the number of cards revealed this way.', '{2}{R}, {T}: Reveal any number of red cards in your hand. Cinder Seer deals X damage to any target, where X is the number of cards revealed this way.', '{2}{U}, {T}: Reveal any number of blue cards in your hand. Counter target spell unless its controller pays {1} for each card revealed this way.', '{2}{W}, {T}: Reveal any number of white cards in your hand. You gain 2 life for each card revealed this way.', '{3}, {T}: Choose a number greater than 0 and a color. Target opponent reveals their hand. If that opponent reveals exactly the chosen number of cards of the chosen color, you draw a card.', '{4}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: Fodder Cannon deals 4 damage to target creature.', '{B}, Sacrifice a creature: Destroy target nonblack creature.', '{B}, {T}, Sacrifice Apprentice Necromancer: Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield. That creature gains haste. At the beginning of the next end step, sacrifice it.', '{B}: Regenerate Phyrexian Monitor.', '{G}, {T}: You may put a creature card from your hand onto the battlefield.', "{G}: Regenerate Ancient Silverback. (The next time this creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", "{T}, Sacrifice a creature: Bloodshot Cyclops deals damage equal to the sacrificed creature's power to any target.", '{T}: Add {C}.\n{G}, {T}: Regenerate target creature.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {G} for each Forest you control.', '{T}: Add {G}.\n{2}, Sacrifice Heart Warden: Draw a card.', '{T}: Prevent the next 4 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.', '{T}: Reveal any number of artifact cards in your hand. Add {C}{C} for each card revealed this way.', '{T}: You gain 1 life.', "{U}{U}{U}, {T}: Return target permanent to its owner's hand.", '{W}: Capashen Templar gets +0/+1 until end of turn.']
